-- ==========================================
-- MOVEMENT SCRIPT v22
-- ==========================================
-- CORE PHILOSOPHY:
--   The bot does ONE thing: stand at the safest
--   spot, wait calmly, then at the perfect moment
--   jump STRAIGHT OVER the laser (perpendicular).
--   It never runs away from lasers.
--
-- CHANGES FROM v21:
--   1. Jump direction is now ALWAYS perpendicular
--      to the laser (straight over it), not toward
--      a far side point along the laser's length.
--   2. Bot now waits at safe position until the
--      laser is close enough, then jumps.
--      No more constant movement / running away.
--   3. Jump timing uses precise TTI window:
--      jump when TTI is between JUMP_MIN_TTI and
--      JUMP_MAX_TTI - the sweet spot to clear it.
--   4. Landing safety check: after computing perp
--      direction, scan all OTHER lasers too.
--      If landing is unsafe, try perpendicular+slight
--      angle adjustment (±15°, ±30°) to find clear.
--   5. Removed airdash and crossing logic -
--      replaced with cleaner in-air steering.
--   6. Human-feel: added small random reaction
--      delay (0.05-0.12s) before each jump.
--   7. Safe pos: bot only repositions when current
--      pos becomes threatened (TTI < REPOSITION_TTI).
--   8. Path visualizer kept but simplified to show
--      only the planned jump arc.
-- ==========================================
print("[Movement] v22 loaded")

